WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Projects. Create projects, then rename, colour, favourite, archive or delete them from the sidebar.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: quarterly initiative; repeatable projects.

3
00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:11.700
Choose New in the workspace sidebar.

4
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:13.870
Name the project…

5
00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:17.380
…and add it.

6
00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:21.050
Star it to pin it under Favourites.

7
00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:22.660
The pencil edits a project: name, colour, archive, delete.

8
00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:28.070
Pick a colour…

9
00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:31.360
Archive hides a finished project and its tasks everywhere.

10
00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:36.070
Archived projects wait under Archived.

11
00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:42.070
There's no Delete in the edit menu: Deleting projects needs Admin or Owner. A project's tasks vanished from Today: The project is archived. Unarchive it to bring its tasks back.

12
00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:46.570
Create a project in one line
